5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to see you all. To ensure we don't overstretch our dear staff, I would like to look into the conservation lab staffing and backlog, and the composition of the volunteer roster.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I agree that we should be thorough. To avoid the usual logistical mishaps, I will examine the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the loan transport costs over three seasons.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I think we need to be honest about what actually draws a crowd. I'll look into the weekend head counts across ten seasons and the five years of visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I want to ensure the gallery can physically handle the requirements of the next exhibition. I will look into the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings in the gallery.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I want to find out where all the money goes! I'll look into the mount-making charges and joiner's rate, and the maintenance log for powered displays. Let's see if I can find some secrets!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,It seems we have a very balanced approach this time. I am glad we are considering both the people and the building. Does anyone else feel we have missed anything important?,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, the coverage seems sufficient for now. We have addressed staffing, logistics, visitor trends, structural limits, and maintenance costs. I believe these data points will provide a logical basis for our selection.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"I agree with Shion. We've covered the bases quite well. I'm personally excited to see if the visitors' actual preferences match our assumptions. It's time to get to the facts, don't you think?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We have a comprehensive list. I believe these details will help us avoid any unforeseen complications with the space itself. I am ready to proceed.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Me too! I'm super ready! I can't wait to see if I find any hidden money-monsters hiding in the logs! Let's go, let's go!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"Since everyone is in agreement and feeling so enthusiastic, I believe we have done our due diligence for this stage. I shall say ""Over"" for this round.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I concur. There is no further need for deliberation until we have the results of our inquiries.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
17,1,3,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm with you all. I've got my list, and I'm ready to see what the visitors have to say.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
