34,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"My findings are a bit worrying. Our conservation lab is severely understaffed with a large backlog, and our volunteers are mostly from the town history circle. We must be careful not to overwork our few remaining experts.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,1,talk,Shion,,"My findings confirm my suspicions. Logistics are a significant weakness; shipping delays from distant lenders have caused openings to slip, and transport costs are consuming nearly a third of our installation budget. We must be cautious with heavy loan reliance.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,"It turns out the visitors are quite clear! They love movement and mechanisms, and they really value seeing people actually working or talking in the gallery. Static displays just don't bring them back for a second visit.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The gallery has strict weight limits in the suspended bay, and evening hires mean we need displays that can be secured or moved. Open arrangements are too risky as they often get damaged by catering staff.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"I found some money-monsters! Custom mounts and joiners are getting way more expensive, and those powered displays are breaking all the time, making us rope off parts of the gallery. We should avoid things that need lots of fancy fixing!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, it is heartening to know that visitors appreciate a human presence. However, @Sakura, your discovery about the powered displays breaking is concerning. We must find a balance between engagement and reliability.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""May"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, your point about maintenance is valid, but we must also consider the financial drain. High transport costs and shipping delays suggest that an exhibition relying heavily on distant loans is a logistical gamble we cannot afford.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, I understand the risk, but we can't just play it safe and bore the public. If we want a hit, we need that energy and movement the visitors are craving. We just need a smart way to do it.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, energy is fine, but not if it's fragile. We need to avoid open arrangements that catering staff might damage during evening hires, and we must respect the weight limits of the suspended bay.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, you're right! If things are too fragile or too heavy, they'll just break or crash, and then we'll spend even more money fixing them! We need something sturdy and simple that doesn't need a fancy joiner!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@May, if the visitors enjoy seeing people work, perhaps we can find a way to include that without relying on complex machinery that @Sakura warns us about. A human touch is much more reliable than a motor.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, that is a logical compromise. If we prioritize local expertise or on-site demonstrations, we simultaneously reduce the shipping risks and costs I discovered while satisfying the visitor preferences May highlighted.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,"@Shion, now you're talking! If we can get people in the room interacting with the guests, we get the ""wow"" factor without the logistical nightmare of shipping things from across the globe. It's a win-win for everyone.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. As long as the exhibition doesn't require heavy installations in the suspended bay or leave fragile items exposed to the evening hire traffic, a focus on local, human-led activity seems the safest and most efficient choice.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! I love it! So we want something that's not too heavy, doesn't need a million expensive mounts, and doesn't break every five minutes! Local stuff sounds perfect because it's closer and easier!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am glad we have found such a lovely consensus. Let us keep these priorities in mind—staff wellbeing, structural safety, and visitor joy—as we review the candidates. I shall say ""Over"" for this round.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shion,,"I agree. We have established a clear set of criteria: minimal reliance on distant loans, low maintenance requirements, and a focus on human interaction. I am ready to evaluate the candidates.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
51,2,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,I'm totally on board. Let's see which of these proposals actually delivers the excitement the public wants without giving us a headache. I'm ready!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
53,2,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We have a solid framework to ensure the gallery remains functional and the budget stays intact. I am ready to see the candidates.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
55,2,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
56,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm ready too! Let's find the perfect show that won't eat all our money or break the floor! I'm super excited!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
